                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="silent-side silent-side-good">
                <div class="silent-side-label">New — signal</div>
                <div class="silent-code silent-code-green">this.data.set(response)</div>
                <div class="silent-effect">
                  <span class="silent-effect-icon">📣</span>
                  <span><strong>Signal announces itself.</strong> "I changed. Chart is watching me. Update it — nothing else."</span>
